---
title: Sheet-Pan Chicken and Asparagus With Olive-Yogurt Sauce
description: This genius sheet-pan dinner gives you a built-in vinaigrette, a creamy olive-yogurt sauce, and shockingly little effort.
image: https://www.seriouseats.com/thmb/dLTaGgi0HSf6shbiASvxvzDgh3I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20250602-SEA-doublesaucechickensheetpan-AmandaSuarez-HERO-837a5f623c9d4a97b4dc7b6fbb1df2a4.jpg
prep time: 10 minutes
